2. **`>=` at the bound:** `promptRetires` is judged `>=`, not `===`, so the post-`worker-died` re-spawn (cycle 3, 4, …) escalates again as the spec's "New since we talked" bullet 3 requires; the log then honestly reads `relaunch cycle 3 of 2`.
